WEBVTT

00:09:28.596 --> 00:09:31.476
that you think really
we should be focusing on?"

00:09:31.476 --> 00:09:32.916
RS: So what is happening is,

00:09:32.956 --> 00:09:37.796
and I think especially in this movement
about transparency in pay,

00:09:37.836 --> 00:09:41.476
I think has really started to really
shift some of the gender gap.

00:09:42.196 --> 00:09:44.876
And so women, I think, are going
in and saying, you know,

00:09:44.916 --> 00:09:47.916
"I want to make more" or
"How much are you paying him?"

00:09:48.356 --> 00:09:53.476
And it's actually translating
into higher earnings for them.

00:09:53.516 --> 00:09:56.916
So I think when it comes to moms,
I think three things.

00:09:56.956 --> 00:10:00.596
So one of the things is
we all have to get very clear